@description "Local fallback routing with dispatch.run"

# Dispatch tries configured member actions in order until one succeeds.
# The first action fails; const is the local fallback candidate.
# This exercises fallback routing only, not recovery of an external service.

@assert: result == "I am the fallback!"

dispatch.run @{ members: [fail, const], payload: { value: "I am the fallback!" } }
